Add Oh My Pi's native lifecycle extension and recognize omp as a parent agent, so a Claude worker cannot reset its pane. Both forms. OMP uses agent_end.willContinue, not Pi's agent_settled event. The extension reports only for the top-level session (ctx.agent.kind), as OMP runs it again in each subagent. The wrapper calls run in order; on Windows each gets 10 s and the turn does not wait for it, as in the Pi extension. Applied after 0011-codex-windows-watcher.patch.

